<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">=F0=9F=92=AD <strong>Principal's=
 Perspective on Production Debugging:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Strategic Investment tro=
ng Observability:</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Proactive vs Reactive</=
strong>: Invest trong monitoring upfront, not after problems occur</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Context Preservation</s=
trong>: Async operations lose context easily - capture it explicitly</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Correlation Across Serv=
ices</strong>: Distributed async operations need end-to-end tracing</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Actionable Alerts</stro=
ng>: Alerts should provide context and suggested actions</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Performance Baselines</=
strong>: Establish normal behavior to detect anomalies</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Production Lessons Learn=
ed:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Silent Failures</strong=
>: 60% c=E1=BB=A7a async bugs were silent failures not caught by basic moni=
toring</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cascade Effects</strong=
>: One slow async operation affected entire system performance</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memory Accumulation</st=
rong>: Async operations created subtle memory leaks over time</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Timing Sensitivity</str=
ong>: Production timing different from development/testing environments</li=
>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>ROI of Comprehensive Asy=
