<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>MTTR Reduction</strong>=
: 75% reduction trong time to identify root cause</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Proactive Prevention</s=
trong>: 80% c=C3=A1c issues caught before user impact</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Developer Productivity<=
/strong>: Less time spent on debugging, more on features</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>System Reliability</str=
ong>: Higher uptime and user satisfaction</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">The key insight: <strong>Async o=
perations are inherently harder to debug, so invest dalam observability inf=
rastructure early and comprehensively.</strong></p>
